  "body": "***With the owners relocating south, here is your opportunity to secure premium coastal living in sought after Churchill Road.*** \r\nArchitecturally designed and built in 2010, this quality elevated, coastal home captures magnificent Hauraki Gulf views from every level. Immaculately presented, it offers four spacious bedrooms, four bathrooms and multiple living spaces; including a stunning living area with a penthouse feel, flowing to a private, sunny courtyard. With a luxurious master retreat and excellent separation for family and guests, there's plenty of space and flexibility for modern living. \r\nJust a short walk to Churchill Cove, coastal walkways and excellent schooling, including Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Spectacular sea views\r\n* Great indoor/outdoor flow\r\n* Solid Tasmanian oak timber floors\r\n* Floor-to-ceiling double glazed joinery maximising natural sunlight \r\n* North facing aspect\r\n* 3 ensuites\r\n* Excellent storage\r\n* Landscaped gardens\r\n* Double internal garaging\r\n* Versatile downstairs studio\r\n* Good off-street parking\r\n* Quality construction: Concrete Block, Cedar & Concrete panels\r\n\r\nThis home offers amazing value and is a must see! Call now to view.",
